0..80 Comment "//! A wheel in a `theory` block: a rule whose output feeds back, one step later,"
81..161 Comment "//! as a port its own body reads. The fed-back port is read under an observation"
162..229 Comment "//! of its sort, one tick, so the loop is guarded; the bare twin is"
230..306 Comment "//! `pathological/circuit/circuit-feed-wheel.gandr`. Feedback follows Katis,"
307..385 Comment "//! Sabadini and Walters [Katis-2002-feedback_trace_fixedpoint_semantics]; the"
386..456 Comment "//! guard follows the feedback rule of Di Lavore, de Felice and Román"
457..519 Comment "//! [DiLavore-2022-monoidal_streams_for_dataflow_programming]."
520..523 Comment "//!"
524..540 Comment "//! - see: #1031"
541..602 Comment "//! - cites: [Katis-2002-feedback_trace_fixedpoint_semantics]"
