678..840 Comment "//! [Katis-2002-feedback_trace_fixedpoint_semantics]: https://doi.org/10.1051/ita:2002009 \"Katis, Sabadini and Walters, Feedback, Trace and Fixed-Point Semantics\""
841..1020 Comment "//! [DiLavore-2022-monoidal_streams_for_dataflow_programming]: https://doi.org/10.1145/3531130.3533365 \"Di Lavore, de Felice and Román, Monoidal Streams for Dataflow Programming\""
1022..1094 Comment "/// A running fold: each step reads the stream\'s value together with the"
1095..1172 Comment "/// previous output through the observation `emit`, and feeds its output back"
1173..1222 Comment "/// as `state`. The block binds `Wheel : Theory`."
